2. Description of scenarios
To evaluate the behaviors of vehicle lateral dynamics on the ROADS driving simulator, we developed several scenarios. In this paper, the two most important scenarios are described:
2.1 N104 scenario
This scenario is based on the French national road named N104. N104 is a fast-way road with a maximum driving speed of 110 km/h. To evaluate higher levels of lateral acceleration of the vehicle, two series of slalom maneuvers are added. The first one is designed with a sinusoid of 0.2 Hz at 70 km/h, and the second one with 0.2-0.3 Hz at 70 km/h. For this test, traffic is also simulated to provide a more immersive experience.
