2.2 CTA1 scenario
The CTA1 scenario corresponds to our vehicle handling evaluation track on the proving ground. It contains different road curvatures with radii varying from 35m to 250m. For this driving test, the driver is asked to drive the car almost at the limit of tire adherence. The maximal lateral acceleration approaches 1g in every bend.
